	('31a9b6a8-c74d-4fad-9dbd-67611ca55588', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'sleep', '2026-05-24', '203a5a03af8d716ae0f5063fa906cc697befb8724f9cb1865f4f3a5a4a61b7cd', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your sleep score of 62 remains well below your 30-day baseline, further compounded by a significant 120-minute sleep debt. You should prioritize recovery today, as your physiological markers indicate a clear need for restorative rest following your recent heavy training load.', '2026-05-24 20:19:37.913197+00', '2026-05-24 20:19:37.897298+00'),
	('5dd6ba78-c8e1-4172-bec0-6bdef81bfd60', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'recovery', '2026-05-11', '9f30eeff46fa92a66cadf1e47000dc3f7029591d5c17a57e1d2bf50c57e17529', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your recovery score of 17 and significantly depressed HRV of 29.03 indicate a state of acute physiological stress. Prioritize immediate rest and sleep hygiene to address your 120-minute sleep debt and recover from this clear systemic fatigue.', '2026-05-24 20:26:19.710799+00', '2026-05-24 20:26:19.663263+00'),
	('da4e4053-e48b-44d2-9eca-e974f7bb2863', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'recovery', '2026-05-23', '2bd35b3b015b8863f8ed1119433dd859fd2eb6ed15a3b0d6e197ca1c6f40f3d1', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your sleep score is critically low at 39, reflecting severe sleep deprivation that significantly compromises your recovery. You must prioritize immediate rest to address the 120-minute sleep debt and normalize your physiological baseline.', '2026-05-23 04:19:36.424411+00', '2026-05-24 20:26:38.745685+00'),
	('d5f209e6-4a8b-44d8-9f33-a4f90b13c165', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'recovery', '2026-05-24', '203a5a03af8d716ae0f5063fa906cc697befb8724f9cb1865f4f3a5a4a61b7cd', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your recovery score of 22 and HRV of 34.71 indicate significant physiological strain and suppressed autonomic function compared to your 30-day baseline. Prioritize extended rest and active recovery today to address your 120-minute sleep debt and the substantial negative TSB of -30.46.', '2026-05-24 13:40:12.434591+00', '2026-05-24 20:26:49.120675+00'),
	('a981f481-04cf-456c-b43c-b7e0b640a1f6', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'dashboard_summary', '2026-05-24', 'f66cd82ceb06df23d977c2e73858ac36ae2f2615019472a709c92488ff84d0bb', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your recovery score is critically low at 22, driven by an HRV of 34.71 which sits significantly below your 30-day baseline. Prioritize rest today to manage your current TSB of -22.81 and address your accumulated sleep debt of 120 minutes.', '2026-05-24 13:33:27.28427+00', '2026-05-24 20:33:41.113171+00'),
	('ae3a3444-b233-42bd-9aee-38217b570fcc', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'time_in_zones', '2026-05-18:2026-05-24:all', 'cc9933f616208175b81567a68beeca7ca2aed509a220a946eb4baaaad2ff647a', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'The athlete demonstrates a heavily aerobic-focused distribution with 71.3% of time in zone 1 and 13.5% in zone 2, indicating a base-building emphasis. This profile is heavily skewed toward low-intensity endurance, lacking sufficient high-intensity stimulus to classify as a traditional polarized or pyramidal model.', '2026-05-24 22:15:31.562198+00', '2026-05-24 22:15:31.523045+00'),
	('003cf7d5-2aaf-471d-8fa8-9bc516663ed4', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'time_in_zones', '2026-05-01:2026-05-31:all', 'f1818376bceb9e938aef5f9195215c0056441d3017bd78d1a61e4b9f5274ef53', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'The athlete exhibits a heavily polarized training distribution with 83.5% of total time spent in zones 1 and 2, indicating a strong focus on building an aerobic base. This significant emphasis on low-intensity volume relative to the negligible time spent in high-intensity zones suggests a highly sustainable, endurance-focused training architecture.', '2026-05-24 22:16:51.928208+00', '2026-05-24 22:16:51.891413+00'),
	('ea4f85f6-9ec8-4b16-9985-dfd77161fcdb', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'recovery', '2026-05-25', 'c8a596feebd1f6359f412116a1b1117efe4d59b6f894ccccf6a67438fe45f4b6', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your current TSB of -22.81 indicates a significant accumulated fatigue load despite today''s lack of training activity. Daily biometric data is currently missing, preventing a complete assessment of your physiological recovery status.', '2026-05-25 10:36:53.800241+00', '2026-05-25 10:36:53.785255+00'),
	('26448035-df4d-4b98-a333-5a5fb8391bce', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'sleep', '2026-05-25', 'c8a596feebd1f6359f412116a1b1117efe4d59b6f894ccccf6a67438fe45f4b6', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Daily biometric data is currently unavailable, preventing an assessment of your sleep recovery metrics. Your 30-day baseline sleep score is 70.33, which provides a reference point for future performance tracking.', '2026-05-25 10:36:54.88482+00', '2026-05-25 10:36:54.874985+00'),
	('0db09873-cc52-454c-9b26-ed922fe87449', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'dashboard_summary', '2026-05-25', '6922a457330705297078edcea7ac3f652c2f0b3033c3a1cadd324211f255d2de', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your current TSB of -22.81 indicates a state of high fatigue, reflecting a recent rapid increase in training load despite a rest day. Your daily biometric data is currently unavailable for a more comprehensive recovery assessment.', '2026-05-25 10:36:58.784216+00', '2026-05-25 10:36:58.740056+00'),
	('b4af2e78-d1e1-4537-b089-657a14875e7b', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'strain', '2026-05-25', '2e1784a78d258715a32cc6123ea1bf8870145b44f3f18105f26ed921e0f2d2b4', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Both biometric and PMC data are currently unavailable, preventing a comprehensive analysis of your strain. Please ensure your wearable device is synced so I can provide an assessment of your training load.', '2026-05-25 10:37:01.482876+00', '2026-05-25 10:37:01.452752+00'),
	('bd29a662-3ab5-48e6-9ae8-c245ecada11c', '1868283c-5a27-4c32-925e-fd7c2fecfdf5', 'training_load', '2026-05-31', 'c71afd2bd4455ba95218754c9d56ecdbdf002ed3e83d4fa74e334974bb8b4de4', 'gemini-flash-lite-latest', 'Your performance data is missing entirely, as all training load metrics including CTL, ATL, and TSB are currently unavailable. Please sync your recent activity logs to enable a comprehensive analysis of your training stress.', '2026-05-25 10:58:45.32035+00', '2026-05-25 10:58:45.303757+00');
